- Let k be the total numbers checked and d be the number of digits
# Complexity
- Time complexity: O(k∗d)
- Space complexity: O(1)

# Code
'''Java []
class Solution {
    public int smallestNumber(int n, int t) {
        for (int i = n; i < Integer.MAX_VALUE; i++) {
            if (digitProduct(i) % t == 0) {
                return i;
            }
        }

        return -1;
    }

    private int digitProduct(int n) {
        int temp = n;
        int product = 1;
        while (temp > 0) {
            int rem = temp % 10;
            product *= rem;
            temp /= 10;
        }

        return product;
    }
}
'''
